,"type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 live: Tracking top moments and best highlights","description":"Tracking the top plays and developments from Week 12.","published":"2026-11-21T18:35:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50541394/week-12-live-highlights","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Army pulls seating prank at Navy's football stadium ahead of Memphis game","description":"The letters were adjusted back in time for Navy's kickoff.","published":"2026-11-21T18:47:15.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50551457/army-navy-seat-prank","type":"Story","byline":"Associated Press","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Houston QB Conner Weigman out; Keisean Henderson gets start","description":"Houston ruled out starting QB Conner Weigman vs. West Virginia due to injury and instead went with true freshman Keisean Henderson, the No. 4 recruit for 2026.","published":"2026-11-21T18:43:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50550966/sources-houston-qb-conner-weigman-henderson-start","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-21T16:04:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What are the conference title game clinching scenarios for Week 12?","description":"Here's what teams from every conference would need to play for their league championship.","published":"2026-11-21T16:00:59.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50512475/conference-title-game-clinching-scenarios-week-12","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan starts QB Bryce Underwood vs. UCLA; Andrew Marsh suspended","description":"Michigan started QB Bryce Underwood over Tommy Carr, who had started the past four games. WR Andrew Marsh, meanwhile, is suspended for Saturday's game vs. UCLA.","published":"2026-11-21T20:46:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50549879/sources-michigan-expected-start-bryce-underwood-vs-ucla","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4867887/terrance-carter-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Terrance Carter Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr.","description":"American football tight end","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:56Z","intro":"Terrance Carter Jr. is an American college football tight end for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Carter Jr. attended Harker Heights High School in Harker Heights, Texas, and committed to play college football for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns over Arkansas State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"LOUISIANA\nAs a freshman in 2022, Carter Jr. took a redshirt. In 2023, he hauled in 28 receptions for 255 yards and three touchdowns. In week 8 of the 2024 season, Carter Jr. made seven catches for 149 yards and a touchdown in a 34-24 victory over Coastal Carolina. During the 2024 season, he recorded 48 catches for 689 yards and four touchdowns. After the 2024 season, Carter Jr. entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nCarter Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He is expected to be the Red Raider's starting tight end."}]}}